  - `const abortController = new AbortController()`
  - `manager.currentActivity = { activityId, abortController }`
  - `await executeActivityInline(..., abortController.signal)`
  - `await MCP.callTool("metabob_post_activity_result", ...)`
- Error handling for template not found
- Proper cleanup in finally block
- Uses Log.create() for all logging (no console.log)
- No TODO or FIXME comments
- All 8 implementation steps completed

